<h1 class="mt-3">Community Guidelines</h1>
<p class="text-muted" style="font-size:14px;">Rules that keep Local Connect safe and useful for everyone</p>

<h2>Be respectful</h2>
<p>Treat all community members with respect. Disagreements are fine — personal attacks, insults, and harassment are not.
</p>

<h2>Share accurate information</h2>
<p>Only post information you know to be true and relevant to your local community. Misinformation can cause real harm,
    especially during emergencies.</p>

<h2>Do not post prohibited content</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Spam or repetitive promotional content</li>
    <li>Harassment or targeted abuse of individuals</li>
    <li>Hate speech based on ethnicity, religion, gender, or other identity</li>
    <li>Scams, fraud, or deceptive offers</li>
    <li>Misinformation or unverified emergency claims</li>
    <li>Explicit, violent, or otherwise inappropriate material</li>
</ul>

<h2>Use alerts responsibly</h2>
<p>Alerts are for urgent, time-sensitive local issues — road closures, power outages, safety hazards, and similar
    events. Do not use the alert type for general announcements or promotions.</p>

<h2>Report harmful content</h2>
<p>If you see a post that violates these guidelines, use the report button. Our admin team reviews all reports and takes
    appropriate action.</p>

<h2>Consequences</h2>
<p>Violations may result in a warning email, post removal, or account suspension depending on severity. Repeated
    violations will lead to permanent removal from the platform.</p>